{"id":7,"title":"Why was I charged twice?","summary":"One of the charges is usually a temporary authorization hold that your bank removes within 3-5 business days.","topics":["billing"],"url":"http://localhost:8888/help/charged-twice/","status":"publish","content":"If you see two charges for one order, one of them is almost always a temporary authorization hold. Your bank places the hold when you order and removes it automatically, usually within 3-5 business days.

Only the charge made when your order ships is final.

If both charges are still there after 5 business days, contact us with your order number and we will refund the duplicate.","last_updated":"2026-10-25T12:04:19+00:00"}
